epochs: 25
batch-size: 64
steps-per-epoch: 125
robust-eval-every: 3
IMAGE_SIZE = 160 (instead of 224)
RESIZE_SIZE = 190

BalancedResNet run:
This was our balanced-capacity model. It used the same residual structure, but
with fewer channels than the wide model.

